        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8070, Belmont Sideplate Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Belmont Entry Door Lockset has a textured backplate that helps bring out the beauty of all the finishes in which it is available. This traditional handleset is a great addition to American Craftsman style homes as well as Colonial style homes. The Belmont Sideplate Lockset is a perfect way to add that old world beauty to your front door with the attention to detail that we always think of when we picture elegance in architecture. The Traditional Belmont Entry Door Lockset is available with a huge selection of knobs and levers, so you can be sure that the end look is something that you'll be proud of.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Belmont Entry Door Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass latch with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Belmont Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): 3-5/8\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8070-specifications.pdf?v=1704262347\"><b>Emtek 8990 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8070-finish.jpg?v=1704354716\" width=\"431\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 8070 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
