                "description": "The Belmont Entry Door Lockset has a textured backplate that helps bring out the beauty of all the finishes in which it is available. This traditional handleset is a great addition to American Craftsman style homes as well as Colonial style homes. The Belmont Sideplate Lockset is a perfect way to add that old world beauty to your front door with the attention to detail that we always think of when we picture elegance in architecture. The Traditional Belmont Entry Door Lockset is available with a huge selection of knobs and levers, so you can be sure that the end look is something that you'll be proud of.\r\n",
